+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause-Patent
+ *
+ * SM-T970 (SM8250/kona) USB CDC-ACM Control Channel Driver for iPadOS 18.
+ *
+ * Hardware facts and precedents:
+ *  - MUIC: MAX77705 I2C slave 0x25 via TLMM North GPIO 28 (SDA) / 29 (SCL)
+ *    (ref/gts7xl-mainline/tools/usbroute.c, MIT; ref/G986N-iOS, BSD-2-Clause)
+ *  - DWC3 core: 0x0a600000, QSCRATCH glue: 0x0a6f8800 (ref/UniXNU-pong, BSD-2-Clause-Patent)
+ *  - GCC Clocks/GDSC: 0x00100000 (SM8250 gcc-sm8250.c, USB30_PRIM_GDSC=0xf004, Master CBCR=0xf010)
+ *  - Apps SMMU: 0x15000000, SID 0 read-only check (SMMUv2 global registers owned by TZ/Hypervisor)
+ *  - IMEM reboot: 0x146bf65c = 0x77665502 (ref/gts7xl-mainline/linux-patches)
+ *  - Ramoops console: 0x9FA40000 (0001-pong-darwin24.patch)
+ *  - Framebuffer: vinfo.v_baseaddr (2800x1752 BGRA)
+ *  - Touch injection: pong_touch_post(type, finger, x, y)
+ *  - Thread snapshot: pong_dump_task_threads_pmsg(task, comm, pid, sec)
+ *  - Standard USB CDC-ACM: driverless on Windows 10/11 (usbser.sys)
+ */
